This has been my best game so far. A dwarven Valkyrie seemed a good
choice for a beginner like me, and it proven so.

Everything went fine until I screwed up Sokoban -which I had only
reached once before-, perhaps because I was trying to do it unspoiled,
perhaps because I was sleepy. No worries, though, I went back and
headed for the Gnomish Mines. Being a dwarf, the mines were quite
peaceful.

On some early level of the mines, I fell into a trap that sent me a few
levels down. I went up to get my pet back, and I found the minetown
-which I hadn't seen before-. I explored most of it, and found there
was a temple with a coaligned priest. I donated all of my gold -just to
find out if it was of any help- and I only got a warm thank-you. Then I
kept exploring -I still hadn't found the stairs up- and found a locked
door. What do I do? - I kick it open, just to annoy the guard or
