said "You're dog meat!" when I tried #chat'ting with him. I then began
to think he might be still angry at me. I read a scroll which I thought
was level-teleport, but happened to be plain teleport. Got rid of him
for a while. Now I had to find the way up without killing many of them.
I eventually got surrounded by guards, and after unsuccessfully
(z)apping wands of Sleep and of Slow Monster I died miserably.

